<title>UK: Copper falls under $2,400 on LME, aluminium dips.</title>
<headline>Copper falls under $2,400 on LME, aluminium dips.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Slumps under $2,400, hit by consistent investment bank sales. Spreads also easing, with more metal being made available for key dates.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Tripped up by copper, likely to lose grip on $1,600 now.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Mostly little-changed.</p>
</text>
